@startuml deployment-diagram
title Sơ đồ Triển Khai Hệ Thống Thực Tế (Deployment Diagram) - BrewLite Coffee
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

actor "Khách Hàng & Nhân Viên" as ClientUser

node "Thiết Bị Người Dùng (Client Devices)" {
  artifact "Mobile Browser / PWA\n(Chrome, Safari Mobile)" as BrowserPWA
}

cloud "Mạng Internet / Cloudflare Network" as Internet {
  boundary "HTTPS / SSL (Cổng 443)\nTLS 1.3 Encryption" as SSLGateway
}

package "Nền Tảng Triển Khai Production (Cloud Host / VPS / Tunnel)" {
  
  node "Frontend Container Node" {
    component "Next.js 14 Web Service\n(Node.js 20 Alpine)\nPort: 3000 (Internal)" as WebContainer
    artifact "Static Assets & PWA Cache\n(Service Worker, Manifest)" as PwaAssets
  }

  node "Backend API Container Node" {
    component "NestJS Application Server\n(Express HTTP Engine)\nPort: 3001 (Internal)" as ApiContainer
    component "Prisma Client ORM\n(Query Engine & Migration)" as PrismaORM
    component "Health Check Monitor\n(GET /api/health)" as HealthMonitor
    component "Logger & Exception Filter\n(Structured JSON Logs)" as LoggerService
  }

  node "Database Container Node" {
    database "PostgreSQL 16 Engine\nPort: 5432 (Internal Only)" as PostgresDB
    storage "Persistent Storage Volume\n(/var/lib/postgresql/data)" as DbVolume
  }
}

package "Hệ Thống Tự Động Hóa CI/CD & Registry" {
  node "GitHub Actions Runner (CI Server)" as GitHubRunner {
    artifact "Pipeline: Lint, Test, Build\n(.github/workflows/ci.yml)" as CiPipeline
    artifact "Quality Gate Status" as QualityGate
  }
  
  node "GitHub Container Registry (GHCR / Docker Hub)" as RegistryNode {
    artifact "Docker Image: brewlite-api:latest" as ApiImage
    artifact "Docker Image: brewlite-web:latest" as WebImage
  }
}

' Connections
ClientUser --> BrowserPWA : Thao tác UI
BrowserPWA --> SSLGateway : HTTPS (Port 443)
SSLGateway --> WebContainer : Reverse Proxy / HTTP Forward (Port 3000)
SSLGateway --> ApiContainer : API Calls / HTTP Forward (Port 3001)

WebContainer ..> PwaAssets : Serves
WebContainer --> ApiContainer : Client-side Fetch (/api/...)

ApiContainer --> PrismaORM : Database Calls
PrismaORM --> PostgresDB : PostgreSQL Native Driver (Port 5432)
PostgresDB --> DbVolume : Lưu trữ dữ liệu bền vững

GitHubRunner --> RegistryNode : Push Docker Image có Tag (Commit SHA)
RegistryNode --> WebContainer : Deploy Container
RegistryNode --> ApiContainer : Deploy Container

note right of PostgresDB
  <b>Bảo mật CSDL:</b>
  • Database nằm trong mạng nội bộ Docker Network (brewlite_net).
  • KHÔNG mở public port trực tiếp ra Internet.
  • Mọi biến môi trường và mật khẩu nạp qua Secret Environment Variables.
end note

note bottom of HealthMonitor
  <b>Giám sát & Tự phục hồi:</b>
  • Health Check URL: /api/health
  • Trả về HTTP 200 { status: 'ok', database: 'connected' }
  • Tự động khởi động lại container khi Health Check thất bại.
end note

@enduml

